{
    "_comment": "grid_app: after a day's close at least trigger_percent below the close before, buy step_percent more of what's held; after one that far above, sell step_percent of it (the rule as it was described: 5% and 5%). A bet that big days partly reverse. Each stock or fund gets an equal sleeve of the account, start_invested of it bought at the close before the start, the rest cash to buy drops with. Compared with the same sleeves held untouched (held), and with the same trades in coin-flipped directions (random). Fixed 2026-11-15.",
